[?2004l[?2004h> # Layout Shift and UX Fixes - Modern Marketplace
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Issues Identified and Fixed
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> The e-commerce app had multiple Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) and visual instability issues that degraded user experience. All issues have been fixed while maintaining existing functionality.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 1. Font Loading Issues (FOUT)
[?2004l[?2004h> **File:** `src/app/globals.css`
[?2004l[?2004h> **Issue:** Custom font had no `font-display` property, causing Flash of Unstyled Text (FOUT) and layout shifts as the font loaded.
[?2004l[?2004h> **Fix:** Added `font-display: swap` to @font-face declaration.
[?2004l[?2004h> ```css
[?2004l[?2004h> @font-face {
[?2004l[?2004h>   font-family: 'CustomFont';
[?2004l[?2004h>   src: url('/fonts/custom.woff2') format('woff2');
[?2004l[?2004h>   font-display: swap;  /* NEW */
[?2004l[?2004h> }
[?2004l[?2004h> ```
[?2004l[?2004h> **Impact:** Eliminates font-related layout shifts and improves perceived performance.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 2. Product Images Without Dimensions
[?2004l[?2004h> **File:** `src/components/ProductCard.tsx`
[?2004l[?2004h> **Issue:** Product images had no width/height or aspect-ratio, causing layout shift as images loaded.
[?2004l[?2004h> **Fix:** Added aspect-ratio container around images.
[?2004l[?2004h> ```tsx
[?2004l[?2004h> <div style={{ aspectRatio: '1', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
[?2004l[?2004h>   <img
[?2004l[?2004h>     data-testid="product-image"
[?2004l[?2004h>     src={product.image}
[?2004lr[?2004h>     alt={product.name}
[?2004l[?2004h>     className="w-full h-full object-cover"
[?2004l[?2004h>   />
[?2004l[?2004h> </div>
[?2004lo[?2004h> ```
[?2004l[?2004h> **Impact:** Reserves space for product images, preventing CLS during image loading.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 3. Product List Loading State
[?2004l[?2004h> **File:** `src/components/ProductList.tsx`
[?2004l[?2004h> **Issue:** Loading state showed minimal "Loading products..." text, causing layout shift when 15 product cards appeared.
[?2004l[?2004h> **Fix:** Display skeleton loaders matching the grid layout during loading.
[?2004l[?2004h> ```tsx
[?2004l[?2004h> {loading ? (
[?2004l[?2004h>   Array.from({ length: perPage }).map((_, i) => (
[?2004l[?2004h>     <ProductSkeleton key={i} />
[?2004l[?2004h>   ))
[?2004l[?2004h> ) : (
[?2004l[?2004h>   visibleProducts.map((product) => (
[?2004l[?2004h>     <ProductCard key={product.id} product={product} />
[?2004l[?2004h>   ))
[?2004l[?2004h> )}
[?2004l[?2004h> ```
[?2004l[?2004h> **Impact:** Maintains consistent layout during data loading.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 4. Banner Loading Issues
[?2004l[?2004h> **File:** `src/components/Banner.tsx`
[?2004l[?2004h> **Issue:** Banner returned `null` while loading, then appeared with `py-24` (96px) padding, causing significant layout shift.
[?2004l[?2004h> **Fix:** Reserve space with minHeight and show loading placeholder.
[?2004l[?2004h> ```tsx
[?2004l[?2004h> <div
[?2004l[?2004h>   data-testid="promo-banner"
[?2004l[?2004h>   className="bg-[#0070f3] text-white py-24 px-4 text-center font-bold text-2xl"
[?2004l[?2004h>   style={{ minHeight: '144px', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}
[?2004l[?2004h> >
[?2004l[?2004h>   {loading ? (
[?2004l[?2004h>     <div style={{ width: '200px', height: '32px', backgroundColor: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)', borderRadius: '4px', animation: 'pulse 2s infinite' }} />
[?2004l[?2004h>   ) : (
[?2004l[?2004h>     promo
[?2004l[?2004h>   )}
[?2004l[?2004h> </div>
[?2004l[?2004h> ```
[?2004l[?2004h> **Impact:** Eliminates banner-related layout shifts.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 5. Late Banner Loading Issues
[?2004l[?2004h> **File:** `src/components/LateBanner.tsx`
[?2004l[?2004h> **Issue:** Late banner returned `null` while loading, then appeared with `py-32` (128px) padding, causing major layout shift.
[?2004l[?2004h> **Fix:** Reserve space with minHeight and show loading placeholder.
[?2004l[?2004h> ```tsx
[?2004l[?2004h> <div
[?2004l[?2004h>   data-testid="late-banner"
[?2004l[?2004h>   className="bg-[#ff6b35] text-white py-32 px-4 text-center font-bold text-[28px]"
[?2004l[?2004h>   style={{ minHeight: '192px', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}
[?2004l[?2004h> >
[?2004l[?2004h>   {loading ? (
[?2004l[?2004h>     <div style={{ width: '250px', height: '40px', backgroundColor: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)', borderRadius: '4px', animation: 'pulse 2s infinite' }} />
[?2004l[?2004h>   ) : (
[?2004l[?2004h>     text
[?2004l[?2004h>   )}
[?2004l[?2004h> </div>
[?2004l[?2004h> ```
[?2004l[?2004h> **Impact:** Eliminates late banner-related layout shifts.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 6. Results Bar Loading Issues
[?2004l[?2004h> **File:** `src/components/ResultsBar.tsx`
[?2004l[?2004h> **Issue:** Results bar returned `null` while loading, then appeared with padding and margin, causing layout shift of content below.
[?2004l[?2004h> **Fix:** Show placeholder with same layout during loading.
[?2004l[?2004h> ```tsx
[?2004l[?2004h> if (loading) {
[?2004l[?2004h>   return (
[?2004l[?2004h>     <div
[?2004l[?2004h>       data-testid="results-bar"
[?2004l[?2004h>       className="flex justify-between items-center bg-[var(--card-bg)] py-4 px-5 mb-5 rounded-lg text-sm"
[?2004l[?2004h>       style={{ minHeight: '40px' }}
[?2004l[?2004h>     >
[?2004l[?2004h>       {/* Placeholder skeletons */}
[?2004l[?2004h>     </div>
[?2004l[?2004h>   );
[?2004l[?2004h> }
[?2004l[?2004h> ```
[?2004l[?2004h> **Impact:** Maintains consistent layout while results bar data loads.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 7. Sidebar Loading Issues
[?2004l[?2004h> **File:** `src/components/SidePane.tsx`
[?2004l[?2004h> **Issue:** Sidebar returned `null` while loading, then appeared with fixed `w-[220px]` width, shifting entire main content area.
[?2004l[?2004h> **Fix:** Maintain fixed width during loading with skeleton placeholders.
[?2004l[?2004h> ```tsx
[?2004l[?2004h> <aside
[?2004l[?2004h>   data-testid="side-pane"
[?2004l[?2004h>   className="w-[220px] shrink-0 bg-[var(--card-bg)] p-5 border-r"
[?2004l[?2004h> >
[?2004l[?2004h>   {loading ? (
[?2004l[?2004h>     <nav>
[?2004l[?2004h>       {/* Skeleton placeholders maintaining same structure */}
[?2004l[?2004h>     </nav>
[?2004l[?2004h>   ) : (
[?2004l[?2004h>     <nav>
[?2004l[?2004h>       {/* Actual content */}
[?2004l[?2004h>     </nav>
[?2004l[?2004h>   )}
[?2004l[?2004h> </aside>
[?2004l[?2004h> ```
[?2004l[?2004h> **Impact:** Eliminates sidebar-related layout shifts.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Testing
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ✅ Build completed successfully with no errors
[?2004l[?2004h> ✅ All TypeScript types valid
[?2004l[?2004h> ✅ All pages prerendered correctly
[?2004l[?2004h> ✅ No changes to class names, ids, or data-testid attributes
[?2004l[?2004h> ✅ All functionality preserved
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Performance Impact
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Improved CLS Score:** Layout shifts eliminated
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Better Perceived Performance:** Loading states provide visual feedback
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Reduced Jank:** Smooth, predictable layout during data loading
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Better Core Web Vitals:** Improved Cumulative Layout Shift metric
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Best Practices Applied
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Font Display:** Using `font-display: swap` for web fonts
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Image Aspect Ratio:** Reserving space for images before they load
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. **Loading States:** Using skeleton screens matching actual layout
[?2004l[?2004h> 4. **Space Reservation:** Using minHeight and consistent sizing during loading
[?2004l[?2004h> 5. **Accessibility:** Maintaining semantic HTML and ARIA attributes
