[?2004l# Layout Shift and UX Fixes - Modern Marketplace

## Issues Identified and Fixed

The e-commerce app had multiple Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) and visual instability issues that degraded user experience. All issues have been fixed while maintaining existing functionality.

### 1. Font Loading Issues (FOUT)
**File:** `src/app/globals.css`
**Issue:** Custom font had no `font-display` property, causing Flash of Unstyled Text (FOUT) and layout shifts as the font loaded.
**Fix:** Added `font-display: swap` to @font-face declaration.
```css
@font-face {
  font-family: 'CustomFont';
  src: url('/fonts/custom.woff2') format('woff2');
  font-display: swap;  /* NEW */
}
```
**Impact:** Eliminates font-related layout shifts and improves perceived performance.

### 2. Product Images Without Dimensions
**File:** `src/components/ProductCard.tsx`
**Issue:** Product images had no width/height or aspect-ratio, causing layout shift as images loaded.
**Fix:** Added aspect-ratio container around images.
```tsx
<div style={{ aspectRatio: '1', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
  <img
    data-testid="product-image"
    src={product.image}
    alt={product.name}
    className="w-full h-full object-cover"
[?2004hroot@67c89d494228:/app# echo '=== LAYOUT SHIFT FIXES COMPLETE ===' && echo && echo 'Files Modified:' && ls -lh src/app/globals.css src/components/*.tsx
